==English==

===Etymology===
From {{bor|en|la|mātrīculātus}}, past participle of {{m|la|mātrīculō|t=to register}}, from {{m|la|mātrīcula|t=public register}}, a diminutive of {{der|en|la|mātrīx|t=list}}.

